  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Nav Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-nav",
      "description": "Single solid action in the top-right of the nav.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-btn-nav\" href=\"#\">Work with me</a>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-nav{display:inline-block;background:var(--btn,#1d1f33);color:var(--btn-ink,#fff);padding:.5rem 1.1rem;border-radius:.6rem;text-decoration:none;font:700 1.125rem/1.6 'Atkinson Hyperlegible',system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap}.ds-btn-nav:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-btn-nav:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--violet, #7444dd);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Primary CTA",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-cta",
      "description": "Ink Violet pill for the page's one main action.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-cta\" href=\"#\">Email me</a>",
      "css": ".ds-cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--cta,#7444dd);color:var(--cta-ink,#fff);padding:.8rem 1.6rem;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;font:700 1.125rem/1.6 'Atkinson Hyperlegible',system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-cta:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}.ds-cta:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--violet, #7444dd);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Outline CTA",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-cta-outline",
      "description": "Secondary pill beside a primary CTA.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-cta-outline\" href=\"#\">LinkedIn</a>",
      "css": ".ds-cta-outline{display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#1d1f33);border:2px solid var(--card-line,#1d1f33);padding:calc(.8rem - 2px) calc(1.6rem - 2px);border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;font:700 1.125rem/1.6 'Atkinson Hyperlegible',system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-cta-outline:hover{background:var(--mark,#e6dcff)}.ds-cta-outline:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--violet, #7444dd);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "button-nav",
      "description": "Caveat wordmark, text links, nav button and theme toggle.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-brand\" href=\"#\">kristi.cy</a><div class=\"ds-nav-links\"><a href=\"#\">LinkedIn</a><a href=\"#\">GitHub</a><a class=\"ds-nav-btn\" href=\"#\">Work with me</a><button class=\"ds-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Switch between light and chalkboard mode\">🌙</button></div></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:1.5rem 0;font:400 1.125rem/1.6 'Atkinson Hyperlegible',system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#1d1f33)}.ds-brand{font:700 1.75rem 'Caveat',cursive;color:var(--violet,#7444dd);text-decoration:none}.ds-nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem}.ds-nav-links a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ds-nav-links a:not(.ds-nav-btn):hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-nav-btn{background:var(--btn,#1d1f33);color:var(--btn-ink,#fff)!important;padding:.5rem 1.1rem;border-radius:.6rem;font-weight:700}.ds-toggle{background:none;border:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1f33);width:2.4rem;height:2.4rem;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1}.ds-nav a:focus-visible,.ds-toggle:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--violet, #7444dd);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "sticky-note",
      "description": "Paper object: pastel note with tape, soft shadow and a gentle tilt.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-note\"><span class=\"ds-note-hand\">♿ always</span><p>Accessibility from day one, not as an afterthought.</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-note{position:relative;max-width:14rem;background:var(--note-green,#ddf3e6);color:#1d1f33;padding:1.25rem 1.25rem 1.5rem;border-radius:.25rem;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgb(30 30 60/.1);transform:rotate(-.8deg);font:400 1rem/1.6 'Atkinson Hyperlegible',system-ui,sans-serif;margin-top:.8rem}.ds-note::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-.6rem;left:50%;width:4rem;height:1.2rem;margin-left:-2rem;background:rgb(255 255 255/.6);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0/.08);transform:rotate(-3deg)}.ds-note-hand{display:block;font:700 1.5rem/1.1 'Caveat',cursive;margin-bottom:.4rem}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Index Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "stat-card",
      "description": "Ink object: company on a ruled header line, one headline number, optional secondary metrics.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-stat\"><h3 class=\"ds-stat-co\">Playroll</h3><p class=\"ds-stat-num\">+30%</p><p>Development velocity after splitting one large team into autonomous squads.</p><ul><li>Cycle time down 25%</li><li>0% regrettable attrition</li></ul></article>",
      "css": ".ds-stat{--accent:var(--violet,#7444dd);max-width:18rem;background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--ink,#1d1f33);border:2px solid var(--card-line,#1d1f33);border-radius:1rem;padding:1.1rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;font:400 1rem/1.6 'Atkinson Hyperlegible',system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-stat-co{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:.04em;margin:0 0 1rem;padding-bottom:.6rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--accent)}.ds-stat-num{margin:0;font-size:2.25rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:var(--accent)}.ds-stat p:not(.ds-stat-num){margin:.5rem 0 0}.ds-stat ul{list-style:none;margin:.75rem 0 0;padding:.75rem 0 0;border-top:2px dashed var(--rule,rgb(29 31 51/.18))}.ds-stat li{position:relative;padding-left:1.1rem;font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.3rem}.ds-stat li::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:.55em;width:.4rem;height:.4rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip",
      "description": "Static outlined pill for skills.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-chips\"><li>TypeScript</li><li>Node.js</li><li>AI agents</li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem;padding:0;margin:0}.ds-chips li{padding:.4rem 1rem;border:2px solid var(--card-line,#1d1f33);border-radius:999px;background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--ink,#1d1f33);font:400 1rem/1.6 'Atkinson Hyperlegible',system-ui,sans-serif}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Polaroid",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "polaroid",
      "description": "Paper object: side-project link card that straightens on hover.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-polaroid\" href=\"#\"><div class=\"ds-polaroid-img\"></div><h3>Braille Buddy</h3><p>An interactive game for learning the braille alphabet.</p></a>",
      "css": ".ds-polaroid{display:block;max-width:20rem;text-decoration:none;color:#1d1f33;background:#fff;padding:.8rem .8rem 1.1rem;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgb(0 0 0/.14);transform:rotate(-1.5deg);transition:transform .2s;font:400 1rem/1.6 'Atkinson Hyperlegible',system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-polaroid:hover{transform:rotate(0) scale(1.02)}.ds-polaroid:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--violet, #7444dd);outline-offset:3px}.ds-polaroid-img{aspect-ratio:1200/630;background:linear-gradient(#ece4ff,#dcecfb)}.ds-polaroid h3{font-size:1.25rem;margin:.75rem 0 0}.ds-polaroid p{margin:0;color:#545a72}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Braille Signature",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Signature footer element: 'kristi' in braille with a handwritten reveal.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-sig\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Signed Kristi, in braille\"><span class=\"ds-braille\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-cell\"><span class=\"on\"></span><span></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class=\"ds-cell\"><span class=\"on\"></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span></span></span><span class=\"ds-cell\"><span></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class=\"ds-cell\"><span></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class=\"ds-cell\"><span></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span></span></span><span class=\"ds-cell\"><span></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span></span><span class=\"on\"></span><span></span><span></span></span></span><span class=\"ds-sig-hand\" aria-hidden=\"true\">that's \"kristi\" in braille ✨</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-sig{display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;color:var(--soft,#545a72)}.ds-braille{display:inline-flex;gap:.55rem}.ds-cell{display:grid;grid-template-rows:repeat(3,.4rem);grid-auto-flow:column;grid-auto-columns:.4rem;gap:.2rem}.ds-cell span{border-radius:50%;border:1px solid currentColor;opacity:.25}.ds-cell span.on{background:var(--violet,#7444dd);border-color:var(--violet,#7444dd);opacity:1}.ds-sig-hand{font:400 1.25rem 'Caveat',cursive;opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s}.ds-sig:hover .ds-sig-hand{opacity:1}@media (hover:none){.ds-sig-hand{opacity:1}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Desk Scrapbook",
    "overview": "By day the site is a desk: dotted notebook paper with things pinned and taped to it. There are pastel sticky notes held on with translucent tape, polaroids of side projects, bold-outlined index cards with numbers on them, and blue pencil scribbles in the margin pointing at what matters. By night the same desk becomes a chalkboard. The paper turns dark green, the ink turns to chalk with a faint glow, and the cards become chalk outlines with slightly uneven corners. The objects and layout stay the same. Only the material changes.\n\nThe backbone is clean and legible. Atkinson Hyperlegible carries every heading, paragraph and number, set large and comfortable. Caveat handwriting, tilted paper and doodles are layered on top as seasoning: labels, asides, one scribble per view. The voice is warm and playful because of what is said and the handwritten touches around it, never at the cost of readability. Page density is low: a single centred column (max 62rem), generous section spacing, and few elements per row.\n\nThe system deliberately rejects corporate or SaaS polish: no gradient heroes, glassmorphism, stock \"tech\" illustration or generic dark-mode dashboards. It also uses no personal photography. The person comes through in voice, handwriting and objects, not a headshot.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Dotted notebook paper (light) and a smudged chalkboard (dark) as the ground.",
      "Paper objects (sticky notes, polaroids) are tilted between about -1.5° and 1.6°, and they cast real shadows.",
      "Ink objects (stat cards, chips, outline buttons) are flat with 2px outlines.",
      "Atkinson Hyperlegible for everything that must be read, and Caveat only for short handwritten accents.",
      "One violet \"ink\" accent, with margin blue and ledger green as supporting pencil colours.",
      "A braille signature in the footer: accessibility shown as a visible detail, not just stated."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Pen Rule",
        "body": "Ink Violet is the only colour that means \"this matters\" or \"act here\". Blue and green are decoration or data. They are never used for CTAs or links.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Sticky Notes Stay Paper Rule",
        "body": "Sticky notes and polaroids keep their pastel or white fill and Night Ink text in the chalkboard theme. They are real paper stuck on a board, and they are never inverted. Their inks come from the theme-fixed `--paper-*` custom properties, never from the theme-switching ones.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Ink-to-Chalk Rule",
        "body": "Every colour token has a chalk counterpart. A new colour needs both a light-paper value and a chalk value before it ships.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Seasoning Rule",
        "body": "Caveat never sets a sentence the visitor must read to understand the page. The one exception is the margin scribble, which carries availability; it stays short, high-contrast and readable by screen readers. Handwriting is capped at about six words per instance, and at most one free-floating scribble per viewport. Everything essential is set in Atkinson.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The No-Small-Hand Rule",
        "body": "Caveat is never smaller than 1.25rem. Below that size, handwriting stops being legible.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Paper-or-Ink Rule",
        "body": "Every new element is either paper (it gets a shadow and may tilt) or ink (it gets an outline and stays straight). Never both, never neither.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Gentle Tilt Rule",
        "body": "Tilts stay within ±2° for objects and ±4° for scribbles. Adjacent objects tilt in alternating directions. Hover straightens the object (rotate 0, scale 1.02) and never adds more tilt.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** decide whether every new element is paper (shadow, slight tilt) or ink (2px outline, straight). See the Paper-or-Ink Rule.",
      "**Do** give every new colour a chalkboard counterpart, and check both themes.",
      "**Do** keep Ink Violet as the only action colour. Violet pills are reserved for the page's one main action (the footer on Home; the hero and footer on Work with me).",
      "**Do** set all essential reading in Atkinson Hyperlegible at 1rem or larger, with body text at 1.125rem and line height 1.6.",
      "**Do** keep the global 3px Ink Violet focus ring, the skip link and reduced-motion handling. When reduced motion is requested, all animation and transitions stop.",
      "**Do** close every page with the braille signature.",
      "**Do** put company names, roles and metrics in Atkinson at full ink, never in Pencil Grey."
